+	YYLLOC_DEFAULT is also invoked for syntax errors.
+	* tests/actions.at (_AT_CHECK_PRINTER_AND_DESTRUCTOR):
+	Error locations include the locations of all the tokens that were
+	discarded, not just the last token.
