+# Wrapper for compilers which do not understand `-c -o'.
+
+scriptversion=2005-05-14.22
+
+# Copyright (C) 1999, 2000, 2003, 2004, 2005 Free Software Foundation, Inc.
+# Written by Tom Tromey <tromey@cygnus.com>.
